# The Encoder reads the feedback, rewrites the section and checks it again.
nav http://127.0.0.1:5173/
? click button | Sign out
nav http://127.0.0.1:5173/
type #login-username | ACC_Juan
type #login-password | Office123!
click button[type=submit] |
wait Proposals
click .nav-item | Proposals
wait ${DOC}
click .series-row | ${DOC}
wait ${FEEDBACK}
text .page-subtitle
shot ${TAG}feedback-seen
click .proposal-section-head | ${SECTION}
wait Save this section
fill .proposal-section-body textarea | ${TEXT2}
click button | Save this section
wait Run the check
click button | Run the check
slowwait checked —
shot ${TAG}redrafted
errors
